{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/42383f01893a8267762ba1055210a6e7.avif?t=1776689614\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your legacy awaits. Choose your noble house and lead your dynasty to greatness in a Middle Ages epic that spans generations. War is but one of many tools to establish your reign, as real strategy requires expert diplomatic skill, mastery of your realm, and true <i>cunning</i>. <strong>Crusader Kings III</strong> continues the popular series made by Paradox Development Studio, featuring the widely acclaimed marriage of immersive grand strategy and deep, dramatic medieval roleplaying.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/bc754bcfa47e51803d44e9777e59d4e5.poster.avif?t=1776689614\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/bc754bcfa47e51803d44e9777e59d4e5.webm?t=1776689614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/bc754bcfa47e51803d44e9777e59d4e5.mp4?t=1776689614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/d7eb1cfb4c647f41f340d5f7810e0e95.webp?t=1776689614\" width=615 height=44 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take command of your house and expand your dynasty through a meticulously researched Middle Ages. Begin in 867, 1066 or 1178 and claim lands, titles, and vassals to secure a realm worthy of your royal blood. Your death is only a footnote as your lineage continues with new playable heirs, either planned\u2026 or not.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover a sprawling simulated world teeming with peasants and knights, courtiers, spies, knaves and jesters, and secret love affairs. An extensive cast of historical characters can be romanced, betrayed, executed, or subtly influenced.   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a vast medieval map stretching from the snowswept Nordic lands to the Horn of Africa, and the British Isles in the west to the exotic riches of Burma in the east. Claim, conquer, and rule thousands of unique counties, duchies, kingdoms, and empires.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/212a898a6ed1e253e3c4d6daf8128b82.poster.avif?t=1776689614\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/212a898a6ed1e253e3c4d6daf8128b82.webm?t=1776689614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/212a898a6ed1e253e3c4d6daf8128b82.mp4?t=1776689614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/85f91c5ea59e48e751ef8e51f28e1187.webp?t=1776689614\" width=615 height=44 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each character is larger than life, with traits and lifestyle choices determining their actions and schemes. Prompt fear and dread as you rule with an iron fist, or inspire your subjects with magnanimous deeds. Genetics can be passed along to your children, be it the gift of genius or crippling stupidity.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Groom your heir with the appropriate guardians or educate them yourself. If found wanting, marry them off or despatch them through other means.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize your ruler and noble house, from appearance to attributes, and create a monarch worthy of all their inherited virtues and vices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/6dc774147d9183cb242678eb633b5ec0.poster.avif?t=1776689614\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/6dc774147d9183cb242678eb633b5ec0.webm?t=1776689614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/6dc774147d9183cb242678eb633b5ec0.mp4?t=1776689614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/511f6ad3afbb0cfc267095be391ad5fb.webp?t=1776689614\" width=615 height=44 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Govern an ever-evolving realm and grant titles to whom you see fit - or usurp your liege to claim their crown as your own. Be wary of rivals, from restless serfs to revengeful concubines.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The shadows stir frequently, and danger lurks around every darkened corner. Recruit agents and other unsavory elements to undermine, blackmail, or murder those who stand in your path. Or be inspired by the bard and ballad, and seduce your way to power and influence. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blood will flow. Assemble men-at-arms units and powerful knights. Manage your battlefield tactics and armies. Raid and plunder nearby lands or hire mercenaries and Holy Orders for your major conflicts.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/78805c1f667803b29cc8475b88bdb9be.poster.avif?t=1776689614\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/78805c1f667803b29cc8475b88bdb9be.webm?t=1776689614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/78805c1f667803b29cc8475b88bdb9be.mp4?t=1776689614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/015a52b129e97a2b4fafcf7766bf435d.webp?t=1776689614\" width=615 height=44 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Be a pious king to invite the religious powers to your side, or design your own faith as you battle between everlasting fame or eternal damnation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Bring novel innovations to your culture and construct mighty castles and bastions to increase the wealth, prestige, and security of your realm. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The paths to follow are limitless: experience thousands of dynamic events and life-altering decisions tailored to each and every conceivable situation and character. There are countless ways of securing and keeping your place in the history books. </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"74eec537ff8111ce0b8940966892c92551700471.jpg","localized_name":"Until Death Do Us Part","name":"Until Death Do Us Part","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158310/74eec537ff8111ce0b8940966892c92551700471.jpg"},{"icon":"dd497d62cc1945f88d52139715b0dc30ca28de21.jpg","localized_name":"Way of Life","name":"Way of Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158310/dd497d62cc1945f88d52139715b0dc30ca28de21.jpg"},{"icon":"c9559c455396af7fde4e5c9c3cbca8a02247631b.jpg","localized_name":"A Legacy to Last the Ages","name":"A Legacy to Last the Ages","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158310/c9559c455396af7fde4e5c9c3cbca8a02247631b.jpg"},{"icon":"075069b7f42491e1d34d51a59bd6a547d2691337.jpg","localized_name":"A House of My Own","name":"A House of My Own","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158310/075069b7f42491e1d34d51a59bd6a547d2691337.jpg"},{"icon":"ff230af3ed2768b083a4ea62855b46b4a5475c61.jpg","localized_name":"Dreadful Ruler","name":"Dreadful Ruler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158310/ff230af3ed2768b083a4ea62855b46b4a5475c61.jpg"},{"icon":"bc18ba6b17f2ccbdbd05a5a4748d853963b03fc7.jpg","localized_name":"Stressful Situation","name":"Stressful Situation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158310/bc18ba6b17f2ccbdbd05a5a4748d853963b03fc7.jpg"},{"icon":"2a8790e1a59c6d06a8499891ff46a526ffd9453f.jpg","localized_name":"Not So Feudal System","name":"Not So Feudal System","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158310/2a8790e1a59c6d06a8499891ff46a526ffd9453f.jpg"},{"icon":"1933ed10a69f4947e323e2f736212c782780a0f1.jpg","localized_name":"The Succession is Safe","name":"The Succession is Safe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158310/1933ed10a69f4947e323e2f736212c782780a0f1.jpg"},{"icon":"7272692e2376b507a51849125ff604d362c48c99.jpg","localized_name":"\u00c1lmost There","name":"\u00c1lmost There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158310/7272692e2376b507a51849125ff604d362c48c99.jpg"},{"icon":"b961372d79f71f4d603c0db20be09e2445a4ab0b.jpg","localized_name":"Last Count, First King","name":"Last Count, First King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1158310/b961372d79f71f4d603c0db20be09e2445a4ab0b.jpg"}],"total":188},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1158310?t=1776689614","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1158310?t=1776689614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/2b60ce19898576e8990a52a95180b74a6f7b2631/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_15.jpg?t=1776689614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/2b60ce19898576e8990a52a95180b74a6f7b2631/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_15.jpg?t=1776689614","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game features moderate violence portrayed in an unrealistic manner, with textual references of violence towards defensless characters, such as children. There is use of offensive language, and depictions of nudity with textual references to sexual activity. There are also textual references to the use of illegal drugs and alcohol."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Chapter V</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/06e194f607cf56662fe8223e2272c393.avif?t=1776689614\" width=1560 height=2188 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Starter Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/3614024e6dc31bf6a2c1c86043508d8c.avif?t=1776689614\" width=616 height=766 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/42383f01893a8267762ba1055210a6e7.avif?t=1776689614\" width=780 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your legacy awaits. Choose your noble house and lead your dynasty to greatness in a Middle Ages epic that spans generations. War is but one of many tools to establish your reign, as real strategy requires expert diplomatic skill, mastery of your realm, and true <i>cunning</i>. <strong>Crusader Kings III</strong> continues the popular series made by Paradox Development Studio, featuring the widely acclaimed marriage of immersive grand strategy and deep, dramatic medieval roleplaying.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1158310/extras/bc754